# {{ project_name }}

{{ description }}

Built with [PRISM](https://github.com/PRISM-GUI/PRISM), fetched by `meson setup` through
`subprojects/prism.wrap`.

## Build

```sh
meson setup builddir
meson compile -C builddir
meson test -C builddir
```

## Run

```sh
./builddir/{{ project_slug }}
```

The window comes from `src/model.hpp`. `app::run` builds it from the struct: every
`core::Field` is a widget, and `core::Derived` is a value that follows the fields it reads.

## Update the template

```sh
copier update
```

That brings PRISM's template improvements into this project.
